---
/**
 * Opening viewport of the full-page cinema: transparent, sits directly on
 * the fixed film backdrop. Carries the single h1.
 */
---

<section class="cinema hero-stage" id="top" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Private Treaty Sale</p>
    <h1>Three Argyle Pink Diamonds</h1>
    <p class="hero-lede">
      The Argyle mine closed in November 2020. No new supply exists. Offered here are three
      certified Argyle pink diamonds, each accompanied by its Argyle certificate, GIA report and
      independent valuation.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button-primary" href="#collection">View the Collection</a>
      <a class="button-ghost" href="#enquiry">Register Interest</a>
    </div>
    <p class="scroll-cue" aria-hidden="true"><span></span>Scroll</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-stage {
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding-bottom: clamp(3rem, 9vh, 6rem);
    background: linear-gradient(
      to top,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 55%, transparent),
      transparent 55%
    );
  }

  .hero-lede {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }

  .button-primary,
  .button-ghost {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-deep);
    transition:
      background-color 0.35s ease,
      border-color 0.35s ease,
      color 0.35s ease;
  }

  .button-primary {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #241318;
  }

  .button-primary:hover,
  .button-primary:focus-visible {
    background: var(--text);
    color: #241318;
  }

  .button-ghost {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .button-ghost:hover,
  .button-ghost:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--text);
  }

  .scroll-cue {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .scroll-cue span {
    display: block;
    width: 1px;
    height: 2.4rem;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--accent));
    transform-origin: top;
    animation: cue 2.6s cubic-bezier(0.45, 0, 0.55, 1) infinite;
  }

  @keyframes cue {
    0%,
    100% {
      transform: scaleY(0.45);
      opacity: 0.35;
    }
    50% {
      transform: scaleY(1);
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .scroll-cue span {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
